Counters for P0.5's demographic, field-reduction and root-water rows, and for
establishment_probability's gate. Apply to plant develop 141dc8df,
rm -f src/*.o src/*.so, rebuild -O2, then run
scripts/demographic_switches.R with PLANT_SWITCH_PROBE=1. Totals go to stderr
at process exit as SWITCHPROBE lines.

PLANT_SWITCH_PROBE_NMP=1 additionally records net_mass_production_dt at
height_0 wherever pr_estab == 0. That costs one extra leaf solve on the SHARED
Leaf, so it perturbs the run: take every other counter from the arm without it.

